{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cargo Shop Simulator</strong>, easily measure and weigh your customers' packages. Inquire about the contents, their destination, and whether they are fragile. Collect payments and label the packages according to their destination. Transport your packages individually or in bulk on pallets, or allow a transport robot to assist you. At the end of the day, load the packages onto vehicles based on their destinations and send them off. Enjoy the experience of running a cargo shop! We plan to introduce features such as fast shipping areas, filling the inside of the box, and rewards and penalties based on the box's fragility soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576250?t=1747941621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576250/e8d69830f98d84f91f074e9e7a391a04eeb30811/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747941621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576250/0926ca7371028aca53710343e047389483899fff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747941621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576250/0926ca7371028aca53710343e047389483899fff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747941621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cargo Shop Simulator</strong>, easily measure and weigh your customers' packages. Inquire about the contents, their destination, and whether they are fragile. Collect payments and label the packages according to their destination. Transport your packages individually or in bulk on pallets, or allow a transport robot to assist you. At the end of the day, load the packages onto vehicles based on their destinations and send them off. Enjoy the experience of running a cargo shop! We plan to introduce features such as fast shipping areas, filling the inside of the box, and rewards and penalties based on the box's fragility soon.</p>","developers":["Enginar Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576250/fa6e9c197dc365e3c15902bf697b177dcef5fd79/header.jpg?t=1747941621","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3576250/847023/a03dcca24e7e0ceccb3aae8cc44d8444d1ddccc0/1750470124/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741941200","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3576250/847023/a03dcca24e7e0ceccb3aae8cc44d8444d1ddccc0/1750470124/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741941200","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3576250/847023/a03dcca24e7e0ceccb3aae8cc44d8444d1ddccc0/1750470124/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741941200","id":257111732,"name":"Early Access Cargo Shop Simulator Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111732/57fa6d0a59e7bbe11a004e3bc006f66517bb0b14/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741941200"}],"name":"Cargo Shop Simulator","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cargo Shop Simulator - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$3.99</span> $2.39 USD","packageid":1261756,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-40% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":239}],"title":"Buy Cargo Shop Simulator"}],"packages":[1261756],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550